 "_about": "Manual reference rep counts from frame-by-frame review of contact sheets and joint-angle traces. 'role': train = used for fitting; test = held out from fitting and used only to report generalisation (then folded in for the shipped fit); hard = held out, reported only (poor light / heavy occlusion / unsupported view); negative clips must count 0 for every exercise listed in 'negative_for'. Expected counts are reps that start from an observed top/extended position, matching the app's rule that a rep must be seen from its start. Push-ups: 'expected' counts reps after the first straight-arm hold (>=0.35 s), because the app calibrates on that hold; 'expected_total' keeps every visible rep where they differ.",
